<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-TONGA WIN IN SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-TONGA WIN IN SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tonga beat an Eastern Province invitation side 34-19 (halftime 15-5) in their rugby union match at Adcock Stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Tonga - Tries: Fepi Tatafu (2), Maama Molitika, Kuli Faletau, Siua Taumalolo. Conversions: Gustavo Tonga (3). Penalty: Tonga.</p>
<p>Eastern Province invitation XV - Tries: Sam Scott-Young, Cecil du Plessis, Willie Enslin. Conversions: Theo van Rensburg (2).</p>
